{"term": {"label": "智", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "1B", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/liang-hui-wang-ii", "title": "梁惠王下", "description": "莊暴見孟子，曰：「暴見於王，王語暴以好樂，暴未有以對也。」曰：「好樂何如？」\n孟子曰：「王之好樂甚，則齊國其庶幾乎！」\n他日，見於王曰：「王嘗語莊子以好樂，有諸？」王變乎色，曰：「寡人非能好先王之樂也，直好世俗之樂耳。」\n曰：「王之好樂甚，則齊其庶幾乎！今之樂猶古之樂也。」曰：「可得聞與？」\n曰：「獨樂樂，與人樂樂，孰", "occurrences": 1, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "事", "id": "事"}, {"form": "仁", "id": "仁"}, {"form": "免", "id": "免"}, {"form": "勇", "id": "勇"}, {"form": "國", "id": "國"}, {"form": "大", "id": "大"}, {"form": "小", "id": "小"}, {"form": "居", "id": "居"}, {"form": "師", "id": "師"}, {"form": "怒", "id": "怒"}, {"form": "智", "id": "智"}, {"form": "木", "id": "木"}, {"form": "玉", "id": "玉"}, {"form": "畏", "id": "畏"}, {"form": "請", "id": "請"}, {"form": "馬", "id": "馬"}], "edges": [{"weight": 3.503218996054467, "source": "免", "target": "事"}, {"weight": 2.9278548511509053, "source": "免", "target": "國"}, {"weight": 2.6559211356672634, "source": "免", "target": "大"}, {"weight": 2.299246191728531, "source": "請", "target": "勇"}, {"weight": 1.7884205679625405, "source": "請", "target": "小"}, {"weight": 1.0464832232331631, "source": "請", "target": "大"}, {"weight": 1.7884205679625405, "source": "怒", "target": "小"}, {"weight": 0.5764795939874274, "source": "大", "target": "國"}, {"weight": 2.2504560275590992, "source": "大", "target": "事"}, {"weight": 0.8641616664392084, "source": "大", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 1.7396304037931083, "source": "大", "target": "小"}, {"weight": 2.6559211356672634, "source": "大", "target": "智"}, {"weight": 1.0464832232331631, "source": "大", "target": "畏"}, {"weight": 1.6750918826555372, "source": "大", "target": "師"}, {"weight": 2.2504560275590992, "source": "大", "target": "木"}, {"weight": 1.7396304037931083, "source": "大", "target": "居"}, {"weight": 2.1169246349345765, "source": "馬", "target": "事"}, {"weight": 1.8937810836203668, "source": "畏", "target": "事"}, {"weight": 1.7884205679625405, "so